37,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, the template meant typing every single invoice! That’s hours of boring work. Who wants to do that every month?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the monitors show a four-fold difference in usage. The old split is objectively wrong. Sub-meters cost 34,000 yen per room, which is steep, but accuracy matters.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, the other house spent forty minutes on it. It’s manageable. But the cooler notice shows people avoiding conflict. We must address that social damage directly.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
