41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, social friction stems from unpredictability, not accuracy. My data shows three late payments caused by shifting amounts. We need a fixed, transparent baseline to prevent that.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Misaki, forty minutes? That’s still a lot! But the winter house just left heaters on. Do we need that much detail, or can we just guess?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, guessing is how resentment starts. The data proves the old split is broken. We need a method that reflects reality, not a convenient fiction.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
