45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I get it! But @Shunichi, sub-meters are expensive. Can we just use the sunlight data to adjust shares? It feels fairer and cheaper!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, sunlight is a proxy, not a measurement. My data shows variance exceeding 4,000 yen monthly. We need precise, verifiable figures to ensure stability and prevent further payment disputes.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Mio, sunlight is too vague! I want to know who actually does the typing. If it takes hours, I refuse to be the one stuck with it!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
